<title>USA: Maxwell Tech names Potashner chairman.</title>
<headline>Maxwell Tech names Potashner chairman.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maxwell Technologies Inc said President and Chief Executive Officer Kenneth Potashner was named chairman.</p>
<p>He succeeds Donn Starry, who has served as chairman since September 1995.</p>
<p>Maxwell was not immediately available to say whether Starry had resigned, or whether Potashner would remain president and CEO.</p>
